            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "original": "「きっとそういうのも計算して設計されてるんだろうな」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Pasti hal-hal seperti itu sudah diperhitungkan dalam desainnya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "original": "諳子",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sorane",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "original": "「楽しみよねぇ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Jadi nggak sabar, ya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "original": "そら姉が食洗機へのセットを終えて、話に加わってきた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sora-nee selesai memasukkan piring ke mesin pencuci dan ikut bergabung dalam obrolan.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "original": "諳子",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sorane",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "original": "「みんなで行ってみたいね。遊園地なんて大昔、二人が小さい頃にみんなで県外のに行ったきりですものね。しかもあんまり大きく無いところ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Pengen deh pergi bareng-bareng ke sana. Terakhir kali kita ke taman hiburan itu sudah lama banget, waktu kalian berdua masih kecil dan kita pergi ke luar prefektur. Itu pun tempatnya nggak terlalu besar」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "original": "「香々見ワンダーランドはＫＡＧＡＭＩって英語表記で海外向けにも準備してるみたいですよ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kagami Wonderland sepertinya juga disiapkan untuk turis asing dengan penulisan bahasa Inggris KAGAMI, lho」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "original": "「県内に国宝とか世界遺産だけじゃなくて、現代的なアミューズメント施設ができるのはなんだかワクワクしますね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Rasanya mendebarkan ya, di prefektur kita nggak cuma ada harta karun nasional atau warisan dunia saja, tapi sekarang ada fasilitas hiburan modern juga」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "original": "「そう言えばこの前、有里栖も準備中の様子を少し見たらすごく楽しみな感じだったって」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ngomong-ngomong kemarin Arisu juga bilang, waktu dia lihat sedikit persiapannya, rasanya seru banget dan dia jadi nggak sabar」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "original": "諳子",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sorane",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "original": "「わあ！いいねー！鷺澤さんのおうちで作ってるんだよね、香々見ワンダーランド」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Wah！ Asyik ya！ Kagami Wonderland itu dibuat oleh keluarganya Sagisawa-san, kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "original": "「そら姉、それだとなんか小さい感じがする」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Sora-nee, kalau bilangnya gitu kedengarannya kayak proyek kecil saja」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "original": "「鷺澤財閥が不動産や電気機械事業、映像エンターテイメント他のあらゆる関連産業のノウハウを結集して作ってるんですよね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Konglomerat Sagisawa mengerahkan seluruh keahlian mereka dari sektor properti, mesin listrik, hiburan visual, dan semua industri terkait lainnya untuk membangun tempat itu, lho」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "original": "諳子",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Sorane",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "original": "「そうそう。わたしもそういうことが言いたかったの。でも、その鷺澤財閥のお嬢さんが楽しみって言うんだから、これは期待も増すよね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Bener banget. Itu yang mau aku bilang. Tapi, karena nona muda dari keluarga Sagisawa itu bilang dia sudah nggak sabar, jadi makin bersemangat, kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "original": "「有里栖は身内贔屓とか、そういうときに盛って話すやつじゃないしな。信頼できる」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Arisu itu bukan tipe orang yang suka melebih-lebihkan cerita cuma gara-gara dia dekat sama orangnya. Jadi bisa dipercaya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
